.190" end="00:24.030">find </span><span begin="00:24.030" end="00:24.210">the </span><span begin="00:24.210" end="00:25.020">words </span><span begin="00:25.020" end="00:25.170">to </span><span begin="00:25.170" end="00:26.610">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.820" end="00:30.570"><span begin="00:26.820" end="00:27.120">All </span><span begin="00:27.120" end="00:27.270">the </span><span begin="00:27.270" end="00:28.230">things </span><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.380">that </span><span begin="00:28.380" end="00:29.190">come </span><span begin="00:29.190" end="00:29.370">to </span><span begin="00:29.370" end="00:30.570">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.020" end="00:35.160"><span begin="00:31.020" end="00:31.380">And </span><span begin="00:31.380" end="00:31.560">I </span><span begin="00:31.560" end="00:32.580">wanna </span><span begin="00:32.580" end="00:33.480">feel </span><span begin="00:33.480" end="00:33.660">it </span><span begin="00:33.660" end="00:35.160">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.220" end="00:39.300"><span begin="00:35.220" end="00:35.580">On </span><span begin="00:35.580" end="00:35.820">an </span><span begin="00:35.820" end="00:36.900">island </span><span begin="00:36.900" end="00:37.590">in </span><span begin="00:37.590" end="00:37.710">the </span><span begin="00:37.710" end="00:39.300">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.330" end="00:43.530"><span begin="00:39.330" end="00:39.660">We'll </span><span begin="00:39.660" end="00:39.870">be </span><span begin="00:39.870" end="00:40.800">playing </span><span begin="00:40.800" end="00:41.010">and </span><span begin="00:41.010" end="00:41.970">having </span><span begin="00:41.970" end="00:43.530">fun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.590" end="00:46.830"><span begin="00:43.590" end="00:43.950">And </span><span begin="00:43.950" end="00:44.100">it </span><span begin="00:44.100" end="00:44.640">makes </span><span begin="00:44.640" end="00:45.030">me </span><span begin="00:45.030" end="00:45.570">feel </span><span begin="00:45.570" end="00:46.110">so </span><span begin="00:46.110" end="00:46.830">fine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.830" end="00:50.700"><span begin="00:46.830" end="00:47.160">I </span><span begin="00:47.160" end="00:47.730">can't </span><span begin="00:47.730" end="00:48.780">control </span><span begin="00:48.780" end="00:49.230">my </span><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:50.700">brain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.060" end="00:55.200"><span begin="00:54.060" end="00:54.570">Hip </span><span begin="00:54.570" end="00:55.200">hip</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.230" end="00:59.430"><span begin="00:58.230" end="00:58.710">Hip </span><span begin="00:58.710" end="00:59.430">hip</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.330" end="01:04.080"><span begin="01:00.330" end="01:00.660">When </span><span begin="01:00.660" end="01:00.990">you're </span><span begin="01:00.990" end="01:01.770">on </span><span begin="01:01.770" end="01:01.860">a </span><span begin="01:01.860" end="01:02.940">golden </span><span begin="01:02.940" end="01:04.080">sea</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.500" end="01:08.400"><span begin="01:04.500" end="01:04.710">You </span><span begin="01:04.710" end="01:05.100">don't </span><span begin="01:05.100" end="01:05.820">need </span><span begin="01:05.820" end="01:06.030">no </span><span begin="01:06.030" end="01:08.400">memory</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.670" end="01:12.570"><span begin="01:08.670" end="01:09.060">Just </span><span begin="01:09.060" end="01:09.150">a </span><span begin="01:09.150" end="01:10.050">place </span><span begin="01:10.050" end="01:10.230">to </span><span begin="01:10.230" end="01:11.070">call </span><span begin="01:11.070" end="01:11.400">your </span><span begin="01:11.400" end="01:12.570">own</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.900" end="01:16.830"><span begin="01:12.900" end="01:13.200">As </span><span begin="01:13.200" end="01:13.350">we </span><span begin="01:13.350" end="01:14.310">drift </span><span begin="01:14.310" end="01:15.270">into </span><span begin="01:15.270" end="01:15.450">the </span><span begin="01:15.450" end="01:16.830">zone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.070" end="01:21.180"><span begin="01:17.070" end="01:17.490">On </span><span begin="01:17.490" end="01:17.700">an </span><span begin="01:17.700" end="01:18.780">island </span><span begin="01:18.780" end="01:19.470">in </span><span begin="01:19.470" end="01:19.620">the </span><span begin="01:19.620" end="01:21.180">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.210" end="01:25.410"><span begin="01:21.210" end="01:21.540">We'll </span><span begin="01:21.540" end="01:21.720">be </span><span begin="01:21.720" end="01:22.680">playing </span><span begin="01:22.680" end="01:22.860">and </span><span begin="01:22.860" end="01:23.850">having </span><span begin="01:23.850" end="01:25.410">fun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.470" end="01:28.710"><span begin="01:25.470" end="01:25.800">And </span><span begin="01:25.800" end="01:25.950">it </span><span begin="01:25.950" end="01:26.520">makes </span><span begin="01:26.520" end="01:26.880">me </span><span begin="01:26.880" end="01:27.420">feel </span><span begin="01:27.420" end="01:27.960">so </span><span begin="01:27.960" end="01:28.710">fine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.710" end="01:32.730"><span begin="01:28.710" end="01:29.070">I </span><span begin="01:29.070" end="01:29.610">can't </span><span begin="01:29.610" end="01:30.660">control </span><span begin="01:30.660" end="01:31.140">my </span><span begin="01:31.140" end="01:32.730">brain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.000" end="01:36.930"><span begin="01:33.000" end="01:33.540">We'll </span><span begin="01:33.540" end="01:34.200">run </span><span begin="01:34.200" end="01:35.340">away </span><span begin="01:35.340" end="01:36.930">together</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01